-- WoW Forever Guide: quest title -> quest ID database.
-- Used by QuestLogSync.lua to skip quests you have already completed:
-- guide steps name quests by title; the sync maps each title to its ID(s)
-- and asks the game (C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted) whether it is done.
-- A title with several IDs (faction/zone variants of the same name) only
-- counts as done when every ID is completed.
-- Titles come in every supported client language (the translated Guides_*
-- files use the official localized titles), so the sync works on any client.
-- Titles and IDs are in-game data for WoW: Forever.

